# Itch Handler

Market Data Feed Handler (Nasdaq ITCH)

Parse raw PCAP files of market data (like Nasdaq ITCH or FIX) to rebuild the real-time state of the market.

The HFT signal: Tests your ability to handle raw network bytes over UDP or TCP with zero-copy parsing.

C++ focus: Network I/O optimization, memory alignment, handling endianness, and strictly avoiding dynamic allocations on the hot path.